# HAT TRICK: the structure. Four worlds of nine screens and a boss, 40
# fixed screens, each the same on both sides (tiles and creatures), with one
# start, the ball on the middle line, holes in the floor only under holes in
# the ceiling, and every place a ball can come to rest within a kid's reach
# (and back). Each world uses its own three kinds of creature, and all three
# of them; the tenth screen of each world is its boss. Four screens in every
# world hide a dessert spot.
game hattrick
wait 5
